{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/7ac84adc6f81e61454b08eba7e1ae73c.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vampire Hunter: Nightrise</strong> is a story about a hunter confronting pride, doubt, and the limits of his own belief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith is not narrative flavor \u2014 it is a core gameplay system. It functions as a finite, dynamic resource that influences combat, exploration, and survival. As conviction weakens, the castle\u2019s influence grows stronger.\u00a0 You'll have to manage faith as carefully as ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/adc237f86b8beb2b64186f33b80965b2.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vampire\u2019s castle looms on the horizon\u00a0\u2014 a place where many hunters have entered... and none have returned. You step inside, armed and confident\u2026 but the gates slam shut behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle is no ordinary fortress. Its halls shift and loop into each other, riddled with traps and secret passageways designed to keep intruders wandering until the vampire awakens \u2014 and when he does, you\u2019re finished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only chance is to master the labyrinth itself. Fight off the castle\u2019s twisted minions in tense FPS combat, uncover the hidden mechanics of its passageways, and carve a path to the vampire\u2019s chamber before Nightrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/6edc085dc08137c3fd00e50dad89516f.poster.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/6edc085dc08137c3fd00e50dad89516f.webm?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/6edc085dc08137c3fd00e50dad89516f.mp4?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/c9200096fba56b9e95761490a32552d2.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolves. Skeletons. And things with names best left unspoken. The castle crawls with the Vampire\u2019s minions \u2014 and you only brought so many stakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash wooden furniture to craft more ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up your shots with the stake launcher to pierce multiple enemies \u2014 or pin them to walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire through flame to ignite your stakes and burn your foes alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/35e6d0bacedb3049ab6c1f66fbda181f.poster.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/35e6d0bacedb3049ab6c1f66fbda181f.webm?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/35e6d0bacedb3049ab6c1f66fbda181f.mp4?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/5d363928c01e84982180864480571a19.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle was built as a maze \u2014 a sanctuary for its master, and a tomb for intruders. Fireplaces rotate, bookcases shift, portraits conceal hidden corridors, and staircases reshape themselves. Every passage leads deeper into its design, every door a new deception.<br><br>You\u2019re not the first to try. The corpses of failed hunters litter the halls, their notes whispering secrets about passageways, traps, and things better left forgotten. Can you learn from their mistakes \u2014 and survive long enough to face what sleeps beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/339b34d34ef0e499dfde829768d5c104.poster.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/339b34d34ef0e499dfde829768d5c104.webm?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/339b34d34ef0e499dfde829768d5c104.mp4?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/9956e88964d86006ed894b43cfb1d3de.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun is setting. Every corridor you clear brings you closer to the heart of the nightmare. When Nightrise comes, it will all be over \u2014 One way or another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/e0b4e911948aed8dfc512b49e5226f71.poster.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/e0b4e911948aed8dfc512b49e5226f71.webm?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/e0b4e911948aed8dfc512b49e5226f71.mp4?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043730?t=1771882731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/cf5df0455005805ebd1e14756d88d911762c7cc2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771882731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/a9f061b907cc6d748ed186c4e8fd6a0b38a2bb83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771882731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/a9f061b907cc6d748ed186c4e8fd6a0b38a2bb83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771882731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Vampire Hunter: Nightrise contains dark and scary segments (although no jump-scares are present). Staking enemies will create small splashes of blood, but that's about the extent of our gore. Overall, mature content in Vampire Hunter: Nightrise is quite minimal."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4353420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/7ac84adc6f81e61454b08eba7e1ae73c.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vampire Hunter: Nightrise</strong> is a story about a hunter confronting pride, doubt, and the limits of his own belief.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faith is not narrative flavor \u2014 it is a core gameplay system. It functions as a finite, dynamic resource that influences combat, exploration, and survival. As conviction weakens, the castle\u2019s influence grows stronger.\u00a0 You'll have to manage faith as carefully as ammunition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/adc237f86b8beb2b64186f33b80965b2.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The vampire\u2019s castle looms on the horizon\u00a0\u2014 a place where many hunters have entered... and none have returned. You step inside, armed and confident\u2026 but the gates slam shut behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The castle is no ordinary fortress. Its halls shift and loop into each other, riddled with traps and secret passageways designed to keep intruders wandering until the vampire awakens \u2014 and when he does, you\u2019re finished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only chance is to master the labyrinth itself. Fight off the castle\u2019s twisted minions in tense FPS combat, uncover the hidden mechanics of its passageways, and carve a path to the vampire\u2019s chamber before Nightrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/6edc085dc08137c3fd00e50dad89516f.poster.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/6edc085dc08137c3fd00e50dad89516f.webm?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/6edc085dc08137c3fd00e50dad89516f.mp4?t=1771882731\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extras/c9200096fba56b9e95761490a32552d2.avif?t=1771882731\" width=630 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Werewolves. Skeletons. And things with names best left unspoken. The castle crawls with the Vampire\u2019s minions \u2014 and you only brought so many stakes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash wooden furniture to craft more ammunition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line up your shots with the stake launcher to pierce multiple enemies \u2014 or pin them to walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire through flame to ignite your stakes and burn your foes alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4043730/extr